/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">扣除；减去；余额；（潮水）涨落；（经济等）起伏；盛衰</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">差し引く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さしひく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">扣除；扣减；克扣；打折；考虑到；体谅；斟酌；涨落；潮涨潮落</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236096\">１０から２を<ruby>差<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くと８です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Subtract two from ten and you have eight.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">刺身</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さしみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刺身（生鱼片、贝类或甲壳类的生切薄片）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168989\"><ruby>刺<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>身<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きではないのでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You don&#x27;t like sashimi, do you?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">些事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">小事；琐事；微不足道的事</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">匙</spa