/rp></ruby>に<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>挿<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He stuck a flower in his buttonhole.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">注す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倒；注；倾；斟；涂；抹；搽；染</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148913\"><ruby>車輪<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃりん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>油<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>注<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したばかりだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;ve just oiled the wheels.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流石</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さすが</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不愧是；果然；正如所料；还是；终究；毕竟；连…都；即使…也</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216826\">さすが、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>期待<rp>(</rp><rt>きたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>裏切<rp>(</rp><rt>うらぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らないね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That&#x27;s just what one would expect of him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">授ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さずける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">授予；给予；赋予；颁发；教授；传授；讲授（知识）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-i