误解；误认；误会；错觉；妄想；错误</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218645\">これはあれよりも<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いように<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるが、<ruby>錯覚<rp>(</rp><rt>さっかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This looks longer than that, but it is an optical illusion.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さっき</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刚才；片刻前；方才；不久前</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75173\">さっきなぜかマイクが<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">For some reason the microphone didn&#x27;t work earlier.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">作曲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さっきょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">作曲；谱曲；音乐创作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222882\">この<ruby>音楽<rp>(</rp><rt>おんがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバッハによって<ruby>作曲<rp>(</rp><rt>さっきょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This music was composed by Bach.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さっさと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迅速；立即；毫不拖延；急匆匆地；急忙地；冷淡地；漠然地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216786\">さっさと<ruby>宿題<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Do your homework without delay.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">察する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さっする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">猜测；感觉；推测；判断；同情；体谅</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221350\">この<ruby>手紙<rp>(</rp><rt>てがみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>察<rp>(</rp><rt>さっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すると<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>立腹<rp>(</rp><rt>りっぷく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているようだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I gathered from this letter that he was angry.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">早速</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さっそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">立即；马上；迅速</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91568\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はベストセラーの<ruby>小説<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>早速<rp>(</rp><rt>さっそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She lost no time in reading a best-selling novel.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迅速地；快速地（尤指动作）；突然地；倏然地（尤指风、雨等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83361\"><ruby>編集者<rp>(</rp><rt>へんしゅうしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>原稿<rp>(</rp><rt>げんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にさっと<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The editor glanced over the manuscript.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さっぱり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感到清爽；感到舒畅；整洁；干净；清爽；坦率；直爽；朴素；简单；清淡；完全；彻底；丝毫不；一点也不（与否定动词连用）；毫无用处；无可救药；糟透了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160868\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことにはさっぱりだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;m a total stranger to things of this kind.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">冊</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">册（计数词，用于书籍）；册；卷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75459\">ポール、8<ruby>冊<rp>(</rp><rt>さつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>までなら<ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りられるからね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Paul, we can borrow up to 8 books.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">札</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">纸币；钞票；纸钞</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li